Scope
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository publishes different components under different terms:

1. Open (MIT below)
   - `dsh-links/` plugin (npm package)
   - `dsh-links-relay/` placeholder / experimental notes
   - Project docs (`README.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `PRIVACY.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`,
     `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`, and similar)
   - Branding assets under `app/branding/` that are original to this project, except where
     `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` says otherwise

2. Closed (not MIT)
   - Android client (`app/` Android Studio project, excluding notices called out above)
   - The client is distributed as a signed APK via GitHub Releases only.
   - Source for the Android client is not a public contribution surface and is
     not licensed for copying, modification, or redistribution.

If you only need the phone-link plugin or the mobile API contract, use the MIT
parts above. Install the Android app from official Release APKs.

